{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-game-theory","title":"创立博弈论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/founding-game-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-theory-of-games","title":"博弈论的创立","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/founding-game-theory/the-theory-of-games","wordCount":1866,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"game-theory-and-economics","title":"博弈论与经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/founding-game-theory/game-theory-and-economics","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"创立博弈论\">创立博弈论</h1><p>本章呈现冯·诺依曼创立博弈论的贡献。冯·诺依曼，创立了研究策略互动的博弈论，为其奠定了数学基础；他更将博弈论应用于经济学，深刻地变革了经济学的研究。两篇文档，分别呈现博弈论的创立，以及博弈论与经济学。</p>\n"}